{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04226","headline":"秋晨同淄川毛司马秋九咏 秋露 · 骆宾王","name":"秋晨同淄川毛司马秋九咏 秋露","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉关寒气早，金塘秋色归。\n泛掌光逾净，添荷滴尚微。\n变霜凝晓液，承月委圆辉。\n别有吴台上，应湿楚臣衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04226.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04226","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}